silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_05_sections_02_concrete_anchor_2#nodetypenewleg silm:hasLongDescription "The NodeTypeNewLeg is the type tag for new leg/quality nodes. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'NewLeg', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
